package A
  @@
  System block
  @@
  part B
    @@
    Flag x
    @@
    let x in boolean
    @@
    Flag y
    @@
    let y in boolean
  part
  requirement R1 top bottom 
    on B::x
  is
    not B::x and B::y or false xor B::x iff true implies B::y
  requirement
  requirement R2 top bottom 
    on B::y
  is
    B::x <> B::y and B::y <> true
  requirement
  requirement R3 top bottom 
    on B
  is
    @@
    Some tests [[B]]
    @@
  requirement
package
